# Recorder B for the L2-MRG-007 pairing cases: its errored record is an exact
# copy of recorder A's (merge-continuation-a.hex), but its continuation holds a
# different word -- the two cards captured different leftovers. Under
# --collapse-duplicates B's error collapses into A's, and B's continuation goes
# with it: a continuation is never kept without its own parent.

# RT15 SA11 Receive, ERRORED -- identical to recorder A's @ .000500
0248 0F18 20DB F401 7E79 0000 0000 1E01

# SPURIOUS_DATA continuation -> 0x2000, stamped @ .000510, word 2222 (A has 0000)
2005 0F18 20DB FE01 2222
